---LINES
var     = ipv   -       -       -       -         "John Smth"
alt1    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "YES"
alt2    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipm   -       -       -       -         " End of work "
---#sp      = h     "space "
sp      = iv    -       -       -       -     "[space]"

---SCREEN                                     
   ."command description". ."key pressed".
 * Get help............... .:HE....           +----------+    
 * Exit, end of the page.. .:EX....          (C) LINLIB  |    
 * Move to next line...... .:NL....           +----------+    
 * Refresh screen......... .:RE....           |   
 * Select menu line:                          +--sample lines-----------------+
              - press....  .sp.....           |   comment/text ."header"....  |
 * Selector cycle/toggle:                     |                               |
              - forward... .sp.....           | ."Active fields"............. |
              - backward.. .:DE....           | .mse............  //menu item |
 * Switch context to edit:                    | .alt2.             //selector |
     - keep content....... .sp.....           | .var.......    //input string |
     - clear before edit.. .:DE....           +-------------------------------+
                                              
=Editing commands (line editor)
 * Complete input.......... .:NL....   * Fast cursor moving: .:KH.... .:KE....
 * Erase character:                       - string begin.... .:PR.... .:AL....
     - left from cursor...  .:DE....      - end of text..... .:PR.... .:AR....
     - below cursor.......  .:KD....   * Toggle INS/OVR:     .:IN....
     - up to end   .:PR.... .sp.....                      or .:PR.... .:PR....

                                          ."LINLIB (C)1986-1990 Sergey Vovk"...
---END
